<title>ESTONIA: MAY PPI 2.4 PCT MO/MO, 11.0 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>MAY PPI 2.4 PCT MO/MO, 11.0 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian producer prices rose by</p>
<p>a monthly 2.4 percent in May for a year-on-year rate of 11.0</p>
<p>percent, the country's statistics department said on  Friday.</p>
<p> ESTONIAN PPI			 May 97  April 97    May 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (PCT)     2.4	 0.8	  -0.1</p>
<p> Year-on-year change (PCT)	11.0	 8.3	  14.5</p>
<p>--Tallinn Newsroom, +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
